              {
                "label": "(Approach)",
                "nextNodeId": "deliver",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "type": "QUEST_ACTIVE",
                    "target": "mazzys_ring",
                    "amount": 0,
                    "negate": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": "(Approach)",
                "nextNodeId": "default_greeting",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "type": "QUEST_ACTIVE",
                    "target": "mazzys_ring",
                    "amount": 0,
                    "negate": true
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "QUEST_COMPLETE",
                    "target": "mazzys_ring",
                    "amount": 0,
                    "negate": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "actions": []
          },
          "default_greeting": {
            "id": "default_greeting",
            "text": "Welcome to Mooncrest. It's quiet here, but I like it that way. My sister Mazzy went adventuring months ago... I haven't heard from her since.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "I hope she's safe. Farewell."
              }
            ]
          },
          "deliver": {
            "id": "deliver",
            "text": "Mazzy's ring... she sent you?\n\n*Frederick turns the ring over in his hands, reading the inscription*\n\n\"Until the tides return.\" ...That's what mother always said. Is she...?\n\n*long pause*\n\nThank you, traveler. She always was too brave for her own good. Please -- take this gold. You've done more for me than you know.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "She wanted you to have it. Take care, Frederick."
              }
            ],
            "actions": [
              {
                "type": "COMPLETE_QUEST",
                "target": "mazzys_ring",
                "value": "",
                "amount": 0
              },
              {
                "type": "SET_FLAG",
                "target": "frederick_vouch",
                "value": "true",
                "amount": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "post_quest": {
            "id": "post_quest",
            "text": "I keep her ring close. Every morning I read the inscription. \"Until the tides return.\"\n\nThank you for bringing it to me, friend. If Mazzy trusted you, then so do I.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "Take care, Frederick."
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "x": 30,
      "y": 28
    },
